  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bb22299b1541e184bbaaba69206c4d2d, type: 3}
  m_Name: LT-1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MonologueLines
  textLines:
  - Those pots.
  - Their pattern reminds the priestess of the time she lived inside one.
  - Living off of scraps she found in a small town.
  - It was Her, an administrator of the town, that dragged the priestess out of the slums.
  - The priestess was immediately taken aback by her beauty.
  - All she asked the priestess to do in return was continue praying at her temple.
  - She gave the priestess back her purpose.
